+"""The front page of this PC's sites ("/"): served by the Home Page project, with News Site under ``/news``.
+
+The Home Page folder (``HOME_PAGE_DIR``, else ``~/Documents/Claude/Home Page``) holds the portal:
+the site list (sites.toml), the page, and how the other sites (CoreLab under ``/infra``) are served.
+Its ``homepage`` package gets News Site here as the app named "news", with what it has now for the
+list. Without that folder (another PC, a test build), or when it cannot be loaded, "/" goes straight
+to News Site. A supervised server restarts when the Home Page code changes (``code_changed``).
+
+Either way, addresses from before the mount keep working: a page address (``/a/123``, a bookmark)
+is redirected to the same page under ``/news``; the translation relay (``/relay/...``, called by
+test builds with a fixed address) is answered where it always was. The public name (テスト公開)
+is marked https and kept out of search results for every site on it.
 """
